5. Computational tools for software design with DSPs;
6. Data acquisition with DSPs;
7. Implementation of Average filters in DSPs using the C language;
8. Implementation of FIR filters in DSPs using the C language;
9. Implementation of IIR filters in DSPs using the C language;
10. Real-time access/control of DSPs;.

